---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Tu libertad financiera comienza aquí">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <div class="relative min-h-screen overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Background effects -->
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true">
      <div
        class="absolute -top-40 left-1/2 h-[600px] w-[600px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-brand-500/8 blur-[150px]"
      >
      </div>
      <div
        class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-[400px] w-[400px] rounded-full bg-accent-500/5 blur-[120px]"
      >
      </div>
      <div
        class="absolute right-0 top-1/2 h-[300px] w-[300px] rounded-full bg-brand-400/5 blur-[100px]"
      >
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Navigation -->
    <nav class="relative z-10 flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-5 lg:px-16">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <div
          class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-500 shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/25"
        >
          <svg
            class="h-5 w-5 text-white"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          >
            <path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="2"
              d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"
            ></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xl font-bold gradient-text">FinanzasAP</span>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-4">
        <button
          id="theme-toggle-landing"
          class="rounded-lg p-2 text-text-secondary transition-colors hover:bg-surface-100 hover:text-text-primary cursor-pointer"
          title="Cambiar tema claro / oscuro"
          aria-label="Cambiar tema"
        >
          <svg id="landing-icon-moon" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M20.354 15.354A9 9 0 018.646 3.646 9.003 9.003 0 0012 21a9.003 9.003 0 008.354-5.646z" />
          </svg>
          <svg id="landing-icon-sun" class="hidden h-5 w-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M12 3v1m0 16v1m9-9h-1M4 12H3m15.364 6.364l-.707-.707M6.343 6.343l-.707-.707m12.728 0l-.707.707M6.343 17.657l-.707.707M16 12a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z" />
          </svg>
        </button>
        <a
          href="/login"
          class="text-sm font-medium text-text-secondary transition-colors hover:text-text-primary"
        >
          Iniciar sesión
        </a>
        <a
          href="/register"
          class="rounded-xl bg-brand-500 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/25 transition-all hover:bg-brand-400 hover:shadow-brand-400/30 pulse-glow"
        >
          Empezar gratis
        </a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hero Content -->
    <main class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pb-20 pt-16 text-center lg:pt-24">
      <!-- Badge -->
      <div class="mb-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-brand-500/20 bg-brand-500/10 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-brand-400">
        <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
          <span
            class="absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-ping rounded-full bg-brand-400 opacity-75"
          ></span>
          <span class="relative inline-flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-brand-400"></span>
        </span>
        Hecho para la nómina ecuatoriana 🇪🇨
      </div>

      <!-- Heading -->
      <h1 class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-7xl">
        Paga menos intereses.
        <br />
        <span class="gradient-text">Libérate más rápido.</span>
      </h1>

      <!-- Subtitle -->
      <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-secondary sm:text-xl">
        Organiza tus deudas y gastos en un cronograma quincenal — qué pagar el 15,
        qué pagar a fin de mes y cuánto te queda del sueldo — con descuento IESS y
        estrategias de pago comparadas.
      </p>

      <!-- CTA Buttons -->
      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row">
        <a
          href="/register"
          class="group flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-brand-500 px-8 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-xl shadow-brand-500/25 transition-all hover:bg-brand-400 hover:shadow-brand-400/30"
        >
          Comienza ahora
          <svg
            class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          >
            <path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="2"
              d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"></path>
          </svg>
        </a>
        <a
          href="#features"
          class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-border-default px-8 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-text-secondary transition-all hover:border-border-hover hover:bg-surface-100 hover:text-text-primary"
        >
          Ver cómo funciona
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Product Preview: mini cronograma -->
      <div class="relative mx-auto mt-16 max-w-4xl">
        <div
          class="pointer-events-none absolute -inset-6 rounded-3xl bg-brand-500/10 blur-2xl"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
        </div>
        <div
          class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border-default bg-surface-50 text-left shadow-2xl"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border-default px-5 py-3">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-danger-500/60"></span>
              <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-warning-500/60"></span>
              <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent-500/60"></span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-text-secondary">Cronograma de Pagos</span>
            <span class="rounded-md bg-brand-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold text-brand-400">quincenal</span>
          </div>
          <div class="overflow-x-auto">
            <table class="w-full min-w-[560px] text-xs sm:text-sm">
              <thead>
                <tr class="border-b border-border-default text-[11px] text-text-muted">
                  <th class="px-5 py-2 text-left font-medium">Concepto</th>
                  <th class="border-l border-border-default px-3 py-2 text-center font-medium text-brand-400">Día 15</th>
                  <th class="border-l border-border-default bg-brand-500/[0.07] px-3 py-2 text-center font-medium text-accent-400">
                    Fin de mes
                    <div class="text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-brand-400">próximo</div>
                  </th>
                  <th class="border-l border-border-default px-3 py-2 text-center font-medium text-brand-400">Día 15</th>
                  <th class="border-l border-border-default px-3 py-2 text-center font-medium text-accent-400">Fin de mes</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr class="border-b border-border-default/50">
                  <td class="px-5 py-2.5">
                    <div class="font-medium text-text-primary">Maestría</div>
                    <div class="text-[10px] text-text-muted">12 cuotas de $219.54</div>
                  </td>
                  <td class="border-l border-border-default/50 px-3 py-2.5 text-center text-text-muted/40">—</td>
                  <td class="border-l border-border-default/50 bg-brand-500/[0.07] px-3 py-2.5 text-center">
                    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md bg-accent-500/15 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold text-accent-400">✓ $219.54</span>
                  </td>
                  <td class="border-l border-border-default/50 px-3 py-2.5 text-center text-text-muted/40">—</td>
                  <td class="border-l border-border-default/50 px-3 py-2.5 text-center text-text-primary">$219.54</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="border-b border-border-default/50">
                  <td class="px-5 py-2.5">
                    <div class="font-medium text-text-primary">Préstamo Banco</div>
                    <div class="text-[10px] text-text-muted">10 cuotas de $186.00</div>
                  </td>
                  <td class="border-l border-border-default/50 px-3 py-2.5 text-center text-text-primary">$186.00</td>
                  <td class="border-l border-border-default/50 bg-brand-500/[0.07] px-3 py-2.5 text-center text-text-muted/40">—</td>
                  <td class="border-l border-border-default/50 px-3 py-2.5 text-center text-text-primary">$186.00</td>
                  <td class="border-l border-border-default/50 px-3 py-2.5 text-center text-text-muted/40">—</td>
                </tr>
                <tr class="border-b border-border-default/50">
                  <td class="px-5 py-2.5">
                    <div class="font-medium text-text-primary">Comida del Hogar</div>
                    <div class="text-[10px] text-text-muted">$80.00/mes · repartido</div>
                  </td>
                  <td class="border-l border-border-default/50 px-3 py-2.5 text-center text-text-secondary">$40.00</td>
                  <td class="border-l border-border-default/50 bg-brand-500/[0.07] px-3 py-2.5 text-center text-text-secondary">$40.00</td>
                  <td class="border-l border-border-default/50 px-3 py-2.5 text-center text-text-secondary">$40.00</td>
                  <td class="border-l border-border-default/50 px-3 py-2.5 text-center text-text-secondary">$40.00</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
              <tfoot>
                <tr class="bg-surface-100">
                  <td class="px-5 py-2.5 text-[11px] font-bold text-text-primary">Lo que queda del sueldo</td>
                  <td class="border-l border-border-default/50 px-3 py-2.5 text-center font-bold text-accent-400">$134.00</td>
                  <td class="border-l border-border-default/50 bg-brand-500/[0.07] px-3 py-2.5 text-center font-bold text-accent-400">$195.41</td>
                  <td class="border-l border-border-default/50 px-3 py-2.5 text-center font-bold text-accent-400">$134.00</td>
                  <td class="border-l border-border-default/50 px-3 py-2.5 text-center font-bold text-accent-400">$195.41</td>
                </tr>
              </tfoot>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Stats -->
      <div
        class="mx-auto mt-16 grid max-w-3xl grid-cols-1 gap-8 rounded-2xl border border-border-default bg-surface-50/50 p-8 backdrop-blur-sm sm:grid-cols-3"
      >
        <div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-400">15 y 30</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-text-muted">
            Cronograma alineado a tu quincena
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-accent-400">9.45%</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-text-muted">
            Aporte IESS calculado automáticamente
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-warning-400">3</div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-sm text-text-muted">
            Estrategias de pago comparadas
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Cómo funciona -->
    <section class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-16">
      <h2 class="text-center text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">
        En <span class="gradient-text">3 pasos</span> tomas el control
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-border-default bg-surface-50/50 p-6">
          <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-500 text-base font-extrabold text-white shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/25">1</div>
          <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">Configura tu sueldo</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            Registra tu sueldo bruto y el sistema calcula el descuento IESS, tu anticipo
            de quincena y el saldo de fin de mes. Décimos y bonos también entran.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-border-default bg-surface-50/50 p-6">
          <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-500 text-base font-extrabold text-white shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/25">2</div>
          <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">Añade deudas y gastos</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            Tarjetas, préstamos BIESS, maestrías en cuotas fijas, y tus gastos del
            hogar — cada uno con su corte de pago: el 15, fin de mes o repartido.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-border-default bg-surface-50/50 p-6">
          <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-500 text-base font-extrabold text-white shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/25">3</div>
          <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">Sigue tu cronograma</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            Ve exactamente qué pagar en cada quincena, cuánto te queda del sueldo,
            registra abonos con un clic y observa cómo tu deuda desaparece.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Features Section -->
    <section id="features" class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20">
      <h2 class="text-center text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">
        Todo lo que necesitas para <span class="gradient-text">tomar el control</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-center text-text-secondary">
        Un motor financiero que analiza tu situación y te da recomendaciones
        claras, no opiniones.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <!-- Feature 1: Cronograma -->
        <div
          class="group rounded-2xl border border-border-default bg-surface-50/50 p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-brand-500/30 hover:bg-surface-100/50"
        >
          <div
            class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-500/15 text-brand-400 transition-colors group-hover:bg-brand-500/25"
          >
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="1.5"
                d="M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">Cronograma Quincenal</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            Tu plan completo por quincenas: qué pagar el 15, qué pagar a fin de mes
            y cuánto te queda del sueldo en cada corte.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 2: Nómina EC -->
        <div
          class="group rounded-2xl border border-border-default bg-surface-50/50 p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-warning-500/30 hover:bg-surface-100/50"
        >
          <div
            class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-warning-500/15 text-warning-400 transition-colors group-hover:bg-warning-500/25"
          >
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="1.5"
                d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">Nómina Ecuatoriana</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            Aporte IESS del 9.45% descontado automáticamente, anticipo de quincena,
            ahorro programado, décimos y fondos de reserva.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 3: Estrategias -->
        <div
          class="group rounded-2xl border border-border-default bg-surface-50/50 p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-accent-500/30 hover:bg-surface-100/50"
        >
          <div
            class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-accent-500/15 text-accent-400 transition-colors group-hover:bg-accent-500/25"
          >
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="1.5"
                d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">Estrategias Comparadas</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            Avalancha, Bola de Nieve o Liquidez: compara intereses proyectados y
            fecha libre de deuda de cada estrategia y elige la tuya.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 4: Cuotas -->
        <div
          class="group rounded-2xl border border-border-default bg-surface-50/50 p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-brand-500/30 hover:bg-surface-100/50"
        >
          <div
            class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-500/15 text-brand-400 transition-colors group-hover:bg-brand-500/25"
          >
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="1.5"
                d="M9 7h6m0 10v-3m-3 3h.01M9 17h.01M9 14h.01M12 14h.01M15 11h.01M12 11h.01M9 11h.01M7 21h10a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">Plan de Cuotas</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            Define en cuántas cuotas pagarás cada deuda y el cronograma muestra
            "cuota 3 de 12" hasta el mes exacto en que la liquidas. 🎉
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 5: Proyecciones -->
        <div
          class="group rounded-2xl border border-border-default bg-surface-50/50 p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-danger-500/30 hover:bg-surface-100/50"
        >
          <div
            class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-danger-500/15 text-danger-400 transition-colors group-hover:bg-danger-500/25"
          >
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="1.5"
                d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">Proyección de Amortización</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            Visualiza mes a mes cómo baja tu saldo, cuánto pagas en intereses y la
            fecha exacta en que quedarás libre de deudas.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 6: Pagos -->
        <div
          class="group rounded-2xl border border-border-default bg-surface-50/50 p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-accent-500/30 hover:bg-surface-100/50"
        >
          <div
            class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-accent-500/15 text-accent-400 transition-colors group-hover:bg-accent-500/25"
          >
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="1.5"
                d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold">Control Total de Pagos</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            Registra abonos con un clic desde el cronograma. ¿Te equivocaste?
            Edita o elimina el pago y el saldo se corrige solo.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA final -->
      <div class="mt-20 rounded-3xl border border-brand-500/30 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-500/15 via-surface-50 to-accent-500/10 p-10 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold sm:text-3xl">
          Deja el Excel. <span class="gradient-text">Empieza hoy.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-xl text-sm text-text-secondary sm:text-base">
          Gratis, en español y pensado para cómo se cobra y se paga en Ecuador.
        </p>
        <a
          href="/register"
          class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-brand-500 px-8 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-xl shadow-brand-500/25 transition-all hover:bg-brand-400 hover:shadow-brand-400/30"
        >
          Crear mi cuenta gratis
          <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"></path>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="relative z-10 border-t border-border-default px-6 py-8">
      <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 sm:flex-row">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <div class="flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-brand-500">
            <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
